            {
              "id": "eff57bc2-1bff-41f7-bca8-68bf659c5ba6",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Secret Games of the Gods: Ancient Ritual Systems in Board Games</strong></em> was written by Nigel Pennick, published by Weiser Books, January 1, 1992."
            },
            {
              "id": "ca05c896-84b5-486b-9f66-793e159cf331",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "9c1b8d61-52e3-43e5-a6ac-4c9dcaa3f7b2",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>The first comprehensive survey of the different methods of </em><a href=\"#/divination\"><em>divination</em></a><em>, this book delves into games originating from many countries and cultures, showing how each is based upon a vision of the universe in which the will of the gods is discovered through </em><a href=\"#/ritual\"><em>ritual</em></a><em> practice.</em>"
            }
          ]
        },
